{
  "id": "minimax-h3-dasiwa-v2-pack",
  "name": "Community — MiniMax H3 (DaSiWa Hybrid v2)",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "Darksidewalker",
  "nsfw": false,
  "description": "Darksidewalker's DaSiWa Hybrid Turbo v2 (2026-09-11): the same drop-in int8 ConvRot finetune idea as the DaSiWa Hybrid pack, now built as the FL2VA weights with a baked-in REF2VA delta and a retuned distillation blend. One checkpoint covers text, image and reference to video, distillation baked in, no Turbo LoRA, nothing to install. WHY A SECOND DASIWA PACK. Measured 2026-09-13 on a 12 GB RTX 4070 Ti against the shipped 4Turbo v1 on the same seed, prompts and graphs: v2 is a different look, not a faster one. At four steps it is softer and darker than v1; at EIGHT steps it gives the most natural portrait of every H3 turbo we ship - clean skin with no oily sheen, no blown key light, defined eyes and lips - where v1 reads bright, high-contrast and crunchy. So this pack defaults to eight steps (about 100 s per five-second shot at 480p, against 72 s for v1) and the v1 pack stays as the fast, punchy option. Identity held on every reference test (solo, two-person, person plus location). Needs a Civitai API key: the author requires sign-in to download, though the model itself is free.",
