          "notes": "ONE checkpoint serves all three presets (19.53 GB). Eight steps by default, euler/simple, sigma shift 12.0 video / 3.0 audio; the distillation is baked in, so there is no Turbo LoRA. Four steps is allowed on the slider but renders noticeably softer on this checkpoint - use the DaSiWa Hybrid (v1) pack if you want the four-step speed. MEASURED 2026-09-13 (RTX 4070 Ti 12 GB, 864x480, 5 s, seed 4242, engine only): eight steps 96-102 s per shot, four steps 72-75 s; the 20-step non-distilled Hybrid v2 gives the same look at 200 s and was not shipped. Compared with the shipped 4Turbo v1 on identical prompts the portrait is lower-contrast with natural skin instead of a bright crunchy read, and texture shots keep rust and paint detail at natural contrast. Reference to video kept every identity on three reference sets. THE DOWNLOAD NEEDS A CIVITAI API KEY: the author requires you to be signed in, so add one in Settings before installing. It is a free model, not paid access."
